<title>BRAZIL: Brazil sells dlrs at 1.0240 in floating tender.</title>
<headline>Brazil sells dlrs at 1.0240 in floating tender.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank sold dollars at 1.0240 reais per dollar in the sell tender in the interbank forex floating rate market, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- Alexandre Caverni, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-2324411</p>
